---
title: SD-03 Inventory - Receive Stock (Stock-in with Batches)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Stock Manager
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as StockIn API
    participant S as InventoryService
    participant D as SQL Server
    M->>F: Choose supplier + enter batch lines
    F->>A: POST /api/stock-in (JWT)
    A->>A: Authorize role = Stock Manager
    A->>S: ReceiveStock(dto, userId)
    S->>S: Validate expiry in future, qty > 0, unique batch number
    alt Validation fails
        S-->>A: Business error
        A-->>F: 400 + message
        F-->>M: Show errors
    else Valid
        S->>D: BEGIN TRANSACTION
        S->>D: Insert StockIn + Batches
        S->>D: Insert StockMovement (+qty) per batch
        S->>D: COMMIT
        S-->>A: StockIn summary
        A-->>F: 201 Created
        F-->>M: Show confirmation summary
    end
    Note over S,D: All inserts succeed together or nothing is saved
